Description: minimalist wallpaper changer for KDE Plasma
 wallshift automatically changes the KDE Plasma desktop wallpaper using
 4K images from the Windows Spotlight API, the same source used by
 Windows 11's lock screen and desktop spotlight features.
 .
 It runs as a lightweight daemon with an optional system tray icon
 (wallshift-tray), avoiding the overhead of larger wallpaper-changer
 applications such as Variety.
